{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00368","headline":"题彭州阳平化 · 蜀太妃徐氏","name":"题彭州阳平化","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云浮翠辇届阳平，真似骖鸾到上清。\n风起半厓闻虎啸，雨来当面见龙行。\n晚寻水涧听松韵，夜上星坛看月明。\n长恐前身居此境，玉皇教向锦城生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蜀太妃徐氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}